{"lang":"zh-TW","total":11,"items":[{"u":"/zh-TW/games/20260925-games-chinas-deck-building-hit-battle-of-the/","t":"中國自走棋遊戲《金鏟鏟之戰》五週年派對盛大登場","h":false,"s":"騰訊自走棋遊戲《金鏟鏟之戰》在深圳舉辦粉絲節慶祝五週年，玩家排隊以手工鏟子換取絨毛獎品。這款手機策略遊戲仍是中國最多人玩的遊戲之一。","i":"https://img.hotnews.pub/2026-09-25/20260925-games-chinas-deck-building-hit-battle-of-the.webp","ci":"🎮","ct":"遊戲","cc":"#eab308","d":"2026年9月25日","m":"閱讀時間 2 分鐘","tg":[{"u":"/zh-TW/tag/games/","l":"遊戲"},{"u":"/zh-TW/tag/tencent/","l":"騰訊"}]},{"u":"/zh-TW/games/20260925-games-chinas-rayshine-studio-debuts-new-hand-drawn/","t":"中國 Rayshine Studio 在 gamescom 首度公開全新手繪奇幻遊戲","h":false,"s":"中國獨立開發商 Rayshine Studio 在 gamescom 2026 公開手繪奇幻冒險遊戲《The Order of Falling Stars》，將於 10 月 9 日在 PC、Switch 2 和 PS5 發售，售價約 14 美元。該遊戲融合中國水墨藝術與動作戰鬥。","i":"https://img.hotnews.pub/2026-09-25/20260925-games-chinas-rayshine-studio-debuts-new-hand-drawn.webp","ci":"🎮","ct":"遊戲","cc":"#eab308","d":"2026年9月25日","m":"閱讀時間 2 分鐘","tg":[{"u":"/zh-TW/tag/games/","l":"遊戲"},{"u":"/zh-TW/tag/technology/","l":"科技"}]},{"u":"/zh-TW/games/20260925-games-chinese-studio-xishanju-sets-october-15/","t":"中國工作室西山居定於10月15日推出最終《劍俠世界》","h":false,"s":"西山居的《劍俠世界4：無限》，其長期武俠系列的最終章，將於10月15日在所有平台開放。該工作室還公布了一段以戰亂古代中國為背景的電影式預告片。","i":"https://img.hotnews.pub/2026-09-25/20260925-games-chinese-studio-xishanju-sets-october-15.webp","ci":"🎮","ct":"遊戲","cc":"#eab308","d":"2026年9月25日","m":"閱讀時間 2 分鐘","tg":[{"u":"/zh-TW/tag/games/","l":"遊戲"},{"u":"/zh-TW/tag/entertainment/","l":"娛樂"}]},{"u":"/zh-TW/games/20260925-games-jonathan-blows-new-puzzle-epic-order/","t":"Jonathan Blow 全新解謎史詩《Order of the Sinking Star》售價 98 元","h":false,"s":"傳奇設計師 Jonathan Blow 的下一款遊戲《Order of the Sinking Star》將於 10 月 9 日在 PC、Switch 2 和 PS5 上推出。其中國售價 98 元，突顯全球工作室如今如何以區域定價爭取中國玩家。","i":"https://img.hotnews.pub/2026-09-25/20260925-games-jonathan-blows-new-puzzle-epic-order.webp","ci":"🎮","ct":"遊戲","cc":"#eab308","d":"2026年9月25日","m":"閱讀時間 2 分鐘","tg":[{"u":"/zh-TW/tag/games/","l":"遊戲"},{"u":"/zh-TW/tag/technology/","l":"科技"}]},{"u":"/zh-TW/g